  "details": "Is something like `IVRCSDKPreprocessAvatarCallback` a PublicAPI?\n\nI have noticed that they are apparently not marked as PublicAPI, even though they are often used.\n\nIf it is PublicAPI, please add Attribute.\n\nNote: There is `OnSdkBuildStart` similar to `IVRCSDKPreprocessAvatarCallback`, which is marked as PublicAPI.\n\nBut there are some differences such as whether the order of execution can be specified and whether it is executed before or after cloning an avatar, so I believe there are demands for both. \n\n(At least there are several tools that would be completely destroyed if IVRCSDKPreprocessAvatarCallback were to be removed.)",
